Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:22.38,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\fad(0,250)\pos(1585,752)}希兒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:22.38,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\pos(1585,815)}『　　』
